                                                "sense_id": "3b48d4ab-4be1-360e-9a33-bacd3c36d50e",
                                                "text": "Out to sea are placoderms – heavily armoured fish, some of them more than six metres (twenty feet) long and equipped with massive, powerful jaws."
                                            }
